  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.pallake.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.pallake.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.pallake.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_pallake">
        <head>ΠΑΛΛΑΚΗ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-1">
          <head>I.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-1-l1">Πολλοὺς λογισμοὺς ἡ πονηρία κυκλοῖ.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. II 4.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Ita Gaisfordus ex codd. pro κυκλεῖ.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-1_2">
          <head>I.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-1_2-l1">Consilia versat multa qui pravis studet.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-2-l1">Ἀλλὰ τῶν χρηστῶν ἔχει τίν᾽ ἐπιμέλειαν καὶ θεός.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. XXXVII 11.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-2_2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-2_2-l1">Quotquot sunt boni, hos ipse vocat ad suam curam deus.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-3">
          <head>III.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-3-l1">Μικρὸν ἐπιμείνας προστρέχει,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-3-l2">ἠγόρακά σοι περιστέρια λέγων.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Athenaeus XIV p. 654 b: περιστέριον — <quote>παρὰ Μενάνδρῳ ἐν Παλλακῇ Μικρόν κτλ.</quote>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">Ita Clericus pro ἐπέμεινας.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-4">
          <head>IV.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-4-l1">Νῦν πῖθι, νῦν ἀφύβρισον. <sp>
                <speaker>Β.</speaker>
                <l part="F" n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-pallake-4-l2">ἣν ἀφύβρικα.</l>
              </sp>
            </l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Lexicon Seguer. p. 473. Ἀφυβρίσαι: τὸ ἀκολάστως ὑβρίσαι δηλοῖ εἰς κόρον καὶ ὥστε ἀποπληρωθῆναι. οὕτω <quote>Μένανδρος Παλλακῇ Νῦν πῖθι κτλ.</quote>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">Editur ἣν ἀφύβρικα. Correxit Dobraeus Adv. II p. 620. Vide supra p. 112.</note>
        </div>
      </div>
